%N A399436 a(n) is the denominator of the probability that two heads will turn up in succession in tossing n times a coin.
%D A399436 Răzvan Gelca and Titu Andreescu, Putnam and Beyond, Springer 2007, pp. 318, 781.
%F A399436 a(n) = denominator(1 - F(n+2)/2^n).
%t A399436 a[n_]:=Denominator[1-Fibonacci[n+2]/2^n]; Array[a,35]
